sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User (Browser)
  participant Client as React Client (SPA)
  participant Firebase as Firebase Authentication
  participant Server as Express Server (/api/v1/auth)
  participant DB as MongoDB (User Collection)

  %% Phase 1: Client Authentication with Firebase
  User->>Client: Enter Email/Password or click Google Sign-In
  Client->>Firebase: createUserWithEmailAndPassword() or signInWithPopup()
  Firebase-->>Client: Returns Firebase User Credential
  
  opt Email/Password Registration
    Firebase->>User: Dispatches Email Verification Link
    User->>Firebase: Clicks Verification Link in Email
  end

  Client->>Firebase: user.getIdToken()
  Firebase-->>Client: Returns Cryptographic Firebase ID Token

  %% Phase 2: Token Exchange & Institutional Validation
  Client->>Server: POST /api/v1/auth/session { idToken }
  Server->>Firebase: firebaseAdmin.auth().verifyIdToken(idToken, checkRevoked: true)
  Firebase-->>Server: Returns Decoded Token (email, email_verified, uid)

  alt email_verified is False
    Server-->>Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden (EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED)
  else Domain Not in ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAINS (BR-10)
    Server-->>Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden (UNAUTHORIZED_DOMAIN)
  else Valid Institutional Account
    Server->>DB: User.findOne({ email })
    alt User Does Not Exist in MongoDB
      Server->>DB: User.create() (Role: ADMIN if ADMIN_EMAIL, else STUDENT/FACULTY)
      DB-->>Server: User record provisioned
    else Existing User
      Server->>DB: Validate user.isActive && user.tokenVersion
      DB-->>Server: User record active
    end

    Server->>Server: Generate JWT (sessionStartedAt, tokenVersion, role)
    Server-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK + Set-Cookie: fixify_token (httpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax, 15m)
  end

  %% Phase 3: Profile Completion Gate
  opt Profile Incomplete (profileComplete === false)
    Client->>Server: GET /api/v1/tickets (Authenticated Request)
    Server-->>Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden (PROFILE_INCOMPLETE)
    Client->>User: Redirects to /complete-profile
    User->>Client: Enters PRN/EmployeeID, Course, Year, Division
    Client->>Server: POST /api/v1/auth/register-profile { prn, course, ... }
    Server->>DB: Updates User (profileComplete = true)
    Server-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK + Profile Completed
  end

  %% Phase 4: Sliding Session Management
  Note over User, DB: Subsequent Authenticated Requests
  Client->>Server: GET /api/v1/tickets (Cookie: fixify_token, Header: X-Requested-With)
  Server->>Server: authenticate middleware checks JWT signature & 8h max ceiling
  Server->>DB: User.findById(id) (verifies tokenVersion matches)
  DB-->>Server: tokenVersion valid
  Server->>Server: Slide session (refreshes fixify_token cookie with new 15m expiry)
  Server-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK + Refreshed Cookie + Data
